              "bio": "Qin Xie is an Associate Professor in the Faculty of Education at the University of Macau. She has published extensively in high-impact journals, such as Assessing Writing, Computer & Education, Educational Psychology, and Language Teaching. Currently, Qin serves as Editor-in-Chief of Language Education & Assessment and Associate Editor of Language Assessment Quarterly and the Journal of Asia TEFL."
