              "name": "Hojung Kim",
              "affiliation": "Seoul National University",
              "bio": "Hojung Kim is a professor in the Department of Korean Language Education at Seoul National University, where she also earned her doctorate in Korean Language Education. In addition, she holds a position as an adjunct researcher at both the Korean Language Education Research Institute and the Learning Sciences Research Institute at Seoul National University. Her primary research area is second- and third-language (L2/L3) acquisition, with a particular focus on the processing, development, and assessment of Korean as an L2/L3."
