              "affiliation": "Seoul National University",
              "bio": "My name is Minkyung Kim, and I am currently a PhD candidate in Department of English Language and Literature at Seoul National University majoring in Applied Linguistics especially langugage assessment under the guidance of Professor Yong-Won Lee. My research focuses on language assessment and natural language processing (NLP), with a particular interest in evaluating paraphrasing and writing abilities of English as a Foreign Language (EFL) learners. I am passionate about exploring how AI technologies, such as large language models (LLMs), can enhance the assessment and learning process for EFL students."
