              "name": "Il-Sun, Hyun",
              "affiliation": "Hansung University",
              "bio": "Il-Sun Hyun is an assistant professor at Hansung University and her research interests are language assessment for learning and AI-driven foreign language assessment. Her recent work has focused on how to integrate AI tools for classroom-based language assessment."
